# Windows

The app ships on Windows only. Develop and script for PowerShell.

- Quote paths. Prefer `path.join` over string concatenation.
- Do not add bash-only scripts. Guard hooks and git helpers are `.ps1`.
- Long paths: repo `core.longpaths` is on. Worktrees go under `%LOCALAPPDATA%\Swarmy\wt\`, not inside the repo.
- Before deleting a worktree: kill the child process tree (`taskkill /pid <pid> /T /F`), `chdir` away from it, then retry with backoff. See decision D7.
- `Remove-Item -Recurse` on a workspace root is a denied command in guardrails. Do not suggest it as cleanup for agent workspaces.

```powershell
# BAD
rm -rf .worktrees
# GOOD
taskkill /pid $pid /T /F
Set-Location $repoRoot
git worktree remove --force $wt
```
